flowchart TB
    Client((Client Browser))

    subgraph "Frontend Layer"
        NextJS["Next.js (React)"]
        UI["Tailwind CSS + Components"]
    end

    subgraph "Backend Layer"
        FastAPI["FastAPI App"]
        Routers["Routers (Auth, TryOn, Catalog)"]
        Services["Business Logic Services"]
        Repos["Repository Layer"]
        Background["Background Tasks"]
    end

    subgraph "Data Storage"
        DB[(PostgreSQL)]
        FileStore[("Local / Cloud Storage")]
    end

    subgraph "External AI Service"
        Gemini{"Google Gemini API"}
    end

    %% Flow connections
    Client <-->|HTTP / JSON| NextJS
    NextJS <-->|REST API| FastAPI

    FastAPI --> Routers
    Routers --> Services
    Routers -.->|Triggers| Background
    Services --> Repos
    Repos <--> DB

    Background -->|Calls SDK| Gemini
    Services -->|Try-On Request| Gemini

    Services -->|Uploads| FileStore
